n_Gale+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Quest_GLO_Moonlantern_Gale+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith\" title=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith\" title=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\">Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 6 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Moonshield\"> Condition: Moonshield </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\">Moonshield</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Protected by the light of a <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> or <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shadow Lantern</a>. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a> does not affect this entity.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-150&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-165</span>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> can craft one from a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Moonlantern\" title=\"Broken Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Moonlantern\" title=\"Broken Moonlantern\">Broken Moonlantern</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Pixie\" title=\"Dead Pixie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Pixie\" title=\"Dead Pixie\">Dead Pixie</a> at the table within <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/38px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/50px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar's</a> hidden room.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Both ingredients can be found in Baltazar's hidden room.</li>\n<li>See <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Experiment\" title=\"Balthazar's Experiment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's Experiment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Experiment\" title=\"Balthazar's Experiment\">Balthazar's Experiment</a> for more information. While in-game dialogue also allows the slim possibility for the player character to craft this item, the option is only available if Gale is present.</li>\n<li>Merely equipping the lantern in the <a href=\"/wiki/Light_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light source\">light source</a> slot is not sufficient to gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith\" title=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/30px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Shadow_Lantern_Wraith\" title=\"Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith\">Conjure Shadow Lantern Wraith</a> ability and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\">Moonshield</a> condition; it must be actively wielded, such as by switching to it via the light source toggle button or equipping it directly in the weapon slot.</li>\n<li>Although not clear from the flavour text's description, the lantern emits a bright sphere of light when used in a weapon slot, providing full protection from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a>.</li>\n<li>Unequipping the lantern or switching back to active weapons via the light source toggle button automatically dismisses the conjured <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/38px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/50px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite being tagged as a <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span> item, the in-game tooltip for the lantern is coloured as a <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span>, like any other <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a>.</li>\n<li>Despite this spell's name, the creature summoned is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/38px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/50px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Shadow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>, not the more powerful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/25px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/38px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/50px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wraith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png/25px-Portrait_Wraith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Portrait_Wraith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\">Wraith</a>. It is is unable to climb surfaces such as ladders and knotted roots, and is unable to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/20px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/20px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/20px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/30px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/20px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Warp\" title=\"Elemental Warp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Elemental_Warp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Warp\" title=\"Elemental Warp\">Warp</a>, meaning it may be unable to follow the party to certain areas. Regrouping is possible by entering a new area or using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/25px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/38px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/50px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Waypoint Map Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/25px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sigil_Circle\" title=\"Ancient Sigil Circle\">Waypoints</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Moonlantern\" title=\"Broken Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Broken_